From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000010 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rk-forge <rk-forge@localhost>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: fix TOPEET GT911 axis mapping

The GT911 reports native X and Y ranges of 600 and 1024 respectively.
Five-corner board measurements show that these axes already match the
panel's physical horizontal and vertical directions.  The differing
numeric ranges are resolution, not orientation; the input consumer
normalizes each native axis to the 1024x600 display.

The touchscreen-size-x/y properties incorrectly replaced the native
ranges with the display dimensions without scaling the values.  Remove
the overrides and let goodix_read_config() publish the controller's real
ranges.  No swap or inversion is required.

Signed-off-by: rk-forge <rk-forge@localhost>
---
 .../boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts       | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts
index 6ca02fb3d..8c5a49f73 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts
@@ -825,8 +825,6 @@ touchscreen@14 {
 		irq-gpios = <&gpio3 RK_PC0 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 		panel = <&lcd_panel>;
 		reset-gpios = <&gpio3 RK_PC1 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
-		touchscreen-size-x = <1024>;
-		touchscreen-size-y = <600>;
 		status = "okay";
 	};
 };
